    "diagnosis": "<p>Intracholecystic papillary neoplasm (ICPN)</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Gastric morphology typically resembles gastric foveolar epithelium, with elongated interconnecting glands lined by tall columnar cells that have abundant pale mucin and diffuse MUC5AC expression.&nbsp;</p>",
    "source": "Olca Basturk",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/31/106/1393.jpg",
